  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8dNQkxR.png\" alt=\"通用鋸木廠模組\" width=\"1217\" height=\"800\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"補充內容 Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"補充內容 Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通用鋸木廠專注於一件事，而且做得很好。<br>此模組新增了一個全新的鋸木廠工作台，讓您可以製作任何木製物品。<br>該功能已完全融入您的世界，搭配獨特的村民房屋與木匠村民，提供無縫的遊戲體驗。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下是所有功能列表：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鋸木廠配方<strong>兼容任何模組</strong>，可製作任何木材衍生方塊</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>木匠村民</strong>可在鋸木廠工作</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">數據驅動的木匠交易</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">木匠附有<strong>5 種獨特房屋</strong>，可生成於您的村莊中，手工打造以完美契合原版村莊風格</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鋸木廠工作台還具有獨特的<strong>鋸木音效</strong><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">KubeJS 整合功能，方便您添加額外配方（您也可以使用資料包）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">數據驅動的村民交易（採用 Moonlight 村民交易系統）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不會大量堆疊額外木製方塊。僅保留鋸木廠</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">相容於 Repurposed Structures</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您是模組包製作者且<strong>不希望動態生成配方</strong>嗎？只需開啟 <em>save_recipes</em> 設定檔，即可將所有配方生成為 JSON 格式，讓您直接靜態添加到您的模組包中！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/otkWqcPNu2A?si=fUhw7QOWF125LxYl\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 致謝 🏆</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plantkillable 負責所有貼圖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Raspmary 負責鋸木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Zapsplat.org 提供原始鋸木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">AlleCraft 負責戰利品表</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Artkek 負責部分建築結構</span></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製作模組佔用了我很多的時間，如果您喜歡我的工作並希望支持我，可以在此處進行。若您支持，將專屬獲得客製化的<strong>地球儀</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！使用優惠碼「supplementaries」在 Akliz 購買伺服器同樣適用此獎勵。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？歡迎查看 Akliz，他們提供專為模組版 Minecraft 打造的高品質伺服器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有非常舒適的社群、優秀的客服支援以及卓越的伺服器品質<br>使用優惠碼「supplementaries」可享<strong>8折優惠</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"幽靈豐收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之精靈\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"儲存標籤\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"神級 GOAT\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡木樹\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯階梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/997/638414771733478975.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed (效果說明)\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡蓮葉\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/992/638414764957723804.png\" alt=\"進度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"隨機礦石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"好眠\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"多色調\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"心石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"地圖圖冊\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"通用鋸木廠\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
